         "prompt": "Substitute your value of $x$ into $3x+5=23$ to check it is also a solution.",
         "answerSpaceMm": 24,
         "answer": {
          "short": "$3(6)+5=23$, so $x=6$ is also a solution. Both equations have solution $x=6$, so they are equivalent.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\mathrm{LHS}&=3(6)+5\\\\&=23\\\\&=\\mathrm{RHS}\\end{align*}$$\nBoth equations have the same solution, $x=6$."
         }
        }
       ]
